{
  "name": "Daily Shopify App Store Pricing, Churn Intel & Unhappy Merchant Outreach Pipeline",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Setup Guide (Zero Hardcoded Secrets)\n1. Create an **HTTP Header Auth** credential (`Apify Bearer Auth`) with Header Name `Authorization` and Value `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN>`.\n2. Edit **Workflow Config** to customize `searchQueries`, `mode` (`app_intelligence` or `merchant_churn_leads`), `dedupStoreName`, and optional `crmWebhookUrl`.\n3. Connect your Slack & Gmail credentials on the notification nodes, then activate the daily 08:00 schedule.",
        "height": 230,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup",
      "name": "Sticky: Setup Guide",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [160, -140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Async Apify Runner (waitForFinish=60)\nCalls `maitreya_buddha~shopify-app-store-churn-intel-merchant-leads` under `LIMITED_PERMISSIONS` on 128MB zero-proxy HTTP with `watchDiff=true` ($0 on unchanged apps) and a clean `RUNNING`/`READY` polling loop (15s wait).",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "sticky-runner",
      "name": "Sticky: Async Runner",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [740, -140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Shopify Churn & Watch-Diff Signal Router\nUses `typeValidation: \"loose\"` Switch routing to send high-priority Shopify apps or veteran merchant churn leads (`churnRiskScore >= 55`, `switcherPriorityScore >= 60`, or `watchTriggers` changes) to **Slack + Gmail + CRM** in parallel.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "sticky-router",
      "name": "Sticky: Signal Router",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1340, -140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 4. Guarded CRM Webhook Delivery\nThe **CRM Webhook Configured?** IF node guards the HTTP Request so unconfigured placeholder URLs are skipped cleanly without workflow errors.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "sticky-webhook",
      "name": "Sticky: Guarded Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [1920, -140]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 8,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "node-1-schedule",
      "name": "Daily 08:00 Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [180, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "cfg-actor-slug",
              "name": "actorSlug",
              "value": "maitreya_buddha~shopify-app-store-churn-intel-merchant-leads",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-mode",
              "name": "mode",
              "value": "app_intelligence",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-dedup-store",
              "name": "dedupStoreName",
              "value": "daily-shopify-app-churn-watch",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "cfg-crm-webhook",
              "name": "crmWebhookUrl",
              "value": "={{ $vars?.CRM_WEBHOOK_URL || '' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-2-config",
      "name": "Workflow Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [420, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "=https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/{{ $json.actorSlug }}/runs",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "waitForFinish",
              "value": "60"
            },
            {
              "name": "memory",
              "value": "128"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"mode\": \"{{ $json.mode }}\",\n  \"searchQueries\": [\"product reviews\", \"email marketing\"],\n  \"maxApps\": 10,\n  \"sampleReviewsPerApp\": 30,\n  \"includeDevWebsiteEnrich\": true,\n  \"generateDashboardHtml\": true,\n  \"watchDiff\": true,\n  \"dedupStoreName\": \"{{ $json.dedupStoreName }}\",\n  \"crmPreset\": \"default\"\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 75000
        }
      },
      "id": "node-3-start-actor",
      "name": "Run Shopify App Churn Monitor",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Apify Bearer Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-run-succeeded",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data?.status }}",
              "rightValue": "SUCCEEDED",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-4-if-succeeded",
      "name": "Run Succeeded?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [940, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-running",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data?.status }}",
              "rightValue": "RUNNING",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "cond-ready",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data?.status }}",
              "rightValue": "READY",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-5-if-running",
      "name": "Still Running?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [940, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "amount": 15,
        "unit": "seconds"
      },
      "id": "node-6-wait",
      "name": "Wait 15s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.wait",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [680, 420]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://api.apify.com/v2/actor-runs/{{ $json.data?.id }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "waitForFinish",
              "value": "60"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 75000
        }
      },
      "id": "node-7-poll",
      "name": "Poll Actor Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [680, 620],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Apify Bearer Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "=https://api.apify.com/v2/datasets/{{ $json.data?.defaultDatasetId }}/items",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "clean",
              "value": "true"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "node-8-fetch-items",
      "name": "Fetch Dataset Items",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [1200, 200],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Apify Bearer Auth"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "outputKey": "high_churn_alert",
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "sw-churn",
                    "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.churnRiskScore || $json.switcherPriorityScore || 0) }}",
                    "rightValue": 55,
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "operation": "gte"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "sw-watch",
                    "leftValue": "={{ Array.isArray($json.watchTriggers) && $json.watchTriggers.length > 0 }}",
                    "rightValue": true,
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "or"
              }
            },
            {
              "outputKey": "standard_crm_sync",
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": false,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "loose"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "id": "sw-std",
                    "leftValue": "={{ Number($json.churnRiskScore || $json.switcherPriorityScore || 0) }}",
                    "rightValue": 0,
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "number",
                      "operation": "gte"
                    }
                  },
                  {
                    "id": "sw-std-app",
                    "leftValue": "={{ Boolean($json.appName || $json.merchantStoreName) }}",
                    "rightValue": true,
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "boolean",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-9-switch",
      "name": "Route By Churn Signal",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [1460, 200]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "#shopify-app-churn-alerts",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "=*Shopify App Churn Signal* — *{{ $json.appName || $json.merchantStoreName || 'Unknown' }}*\n• Mode: {{ $json.recordType || 'n/a' }} | Churn/Switcher Score: {{ $json.churnRiskScore ?? $json.switcherPriorityScore ?? 0 }}\n• Rating: {{ $json.overallRating ?? $json.reviewRating ?? 'n/a' }}★ (Recent: {{ $json.recentReviewsAvg ?? 'n/a' }}★ | Built for Shopify: {{ $json.isBuiltForShopify ?? 'n/a' }})\n• Pricing: ${{ $json.minPaidPriceUsd ?? 0 }}/mo ({{ $json.pricingModel || 'n/a' }}) | Top Pain: {{ $json.topPainBucket || 'n/a' }}\n• Contact / Store: {{ $json.developerSupportEmail || $json.merchantStoreName || 'n/a' }}\n• Watch Triggers: {{ (Array.isArray($json.watchTriggers) ? $json.watchTriggers : []).join(', ') || 'baseline' }}\n• Pitch: {{ $json.outreachSubject || $json.suggestedCompetitorPitch || 'n/a' }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "node-10-slack",
      "name": "Send Slack Churn Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [1740, 80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $vars?.ALERT_EMAIL || 'team@example.com' }}",
        "subject": "=[Shopify App Churn Alert] {{ $json.appName || $json.merchantStoreName || 'Unknown' }} — {{ $json.outreachSubject || $json.topPainBucket || 'Churn Signal' }}",
        "emailType": "text",
        "message": "=Target: {{ $json.appName || $json.merchantStoreName || 'Unknown' }} ({{ $json.appHandle || 'n/a' }})\nRecord Type: {{ $json.recordType || 'n/a' }}\nChurn / Switcher Score: {{ $json.churnRiskScore ?? $json.switcherPriorityScore ?? 0 }} | Micro-PE Score: {{ $json.microPeAcquisitionScore ?? 'n/a' }}\nBuilt for Shopify: {{ $json.isBuiltForShopify ?? 'n/a' }} | Min Paid USD: ${{ $json.minPaidPriceUsd ?? 0 }}/mo\nLifetime vs Recent Rating: {{ $json.overallRating ?? 'n/a' }} vs {{ $json.recentReviewsAvg ?? 'n/a' }} (Critical Share: {{ $json.criticalSharePct ?? 'n/a' }}%)\nTop Pain Bucket: {{ $json.topPainBucket || 'n/a' }}\nDeveloper Email: {{ $json.developerSupportEmail || 'n/a' }} | Website: {{ $json.developerWebsiteUrl || 'n/a' }}\n\nSuggested Outreach:\n{{ $json.outreachBody || $json.suggestedCompetitorPitch || 'n/a' }}\n\nShopify App URL:\n{{ $json.appUrl || $json.reviewUrl || 'n/a' }}"
      },
      "id": "node-11-gmail",
      "name": "Send Gmail Digest Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [1740, 260]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": false,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "cond-webhook-set",
              "leftValue": "={{ $('Workflow Config').first()?.json?.crmWebhookUrl || '' }}",
              "rightValue": "https://",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "startsWith"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "node-12-if-webhook",
      "name": "CRM Webhook Configured?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1740, 440]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Workflow Config').first()?.json?.crmWebhookUrl || '' }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "node-13-crm-webhook",
      "name": "Push To CRM Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [2020, 440],
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CRM_WEBHOOK_HEADER_AUTH",
          "name": "CRM Webhook Header Auth"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Daily 08:00 Trigger": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Workflow Config", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Workflow Config": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Run Shopify App Churn Monitor", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Run Shopify App Churn Monitor": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Run Succeeded?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Run Succeeded?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Fetch Dataset Items", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        [{ "node": "Still Running?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]
      ]
    },
    "Still Running?": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Wait 15s", "type": "main", "index": 0 }], []]
    },
    "Wait 15s": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Poll Actor Run", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Poll Actor Run": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Run Succeeded?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Fetch Dataset Items": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Route By Churn Signal", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Route By Churn Signal": {
      "main": [
        [
          { "node": "Send Slack Churn Alert", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
          { "node": "Send Gmail Digest Alert", "type": "main", "index": 0 },
          { "node": "CRM Webhook Configured?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ],
        [
          { "node": "CRM Webhook Configured?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "CRM Webhook Configured?": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Push To CRM Webhook", "type": "main", "index": 0 }], []]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
